# ====================================================================
# 🎟️ Gemini Media Pass - Configuration (.env)
# ====================================================================

# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 1: 100% Zero-Trust Official API Key (Recommended & Safest)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Get a free API key at: https://aistudio.google.com
# - 100% sandboxed (No personal cookies or Google account access required)
# - Scoped purely to model inference
# - Powers Video Analysis, Vision, Audio, TTS, 2M Document Reading, and Reasoning
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 2: Consumer Subscription Session (For Veo 3.1 & Google Flow)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Only required if you want to use Google Flow (Veo 3.1 Video Studio)
# Run `gemini-media-pass-login` to authenticate via Google Chrome
# Session tokens are cached securely in ~/.gflow
